    "description": "## Outcome and context\n\nEmily finds the current placement of Related Referrer Record confusing and suggested it makes more sense higher up, in the player information box.\n\n## Current state\n\nBUILD-174 (PL-2, WAGR-43) defines Related Referrer Record as a cross-reference-only lookup to Referrer, \"for when this player is also a referrer,\" with no merge logic. Its current position on the page layout is lower down, per the prototype/build-to-date, separate from the core player information section.\n\n## Proposed solution\n\nMove the Related Referrer Record field into the player information box near the top of the Player page, alongside the other core identity fields.\n\n## Acceptance criteria\n\n1. Related Referrer Record displays in the player information section, not in its current lower placement.\n2. No change to the field's behavior — still a cross-reference lookup only, no merge logic.\n\n## Dependencies\n\nDepends on BUILD-174 — Player: Attribution fields (WAGR-43).\n\n## Source\n\nWagertech Notes / Questions (Emily Vandenberg), Player record doc, reviewed Sep 2026: \"Related Referrer Profile - does it make more sense to move this up to the player information box? Feels confusing in its current placement.\" https://docs.google.com/document/d/1mp3b1qpJkzKNDztEQpdnv-BYCgUgDdXe5jLuJi-ix1U/edit?tab=t.0",
